 there in East liberty and he was called the Black Prince of East Liberty. I met him when I was 12 years old. He taught me to drive a car. In fact there was about 6 young girls where we went to school. They could all drive but they had to ask me if they could drive the car. He played a very important part in my career.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12279$548A8E3A-F034-46B7-BCD0-32ACD248C281", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "8050336e4341e2e438c83ea05e087f55f261c631", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/7f2d6063335b48edf115ddc57d56bb92/91.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12279$63EE9C2B-3B51-4DA7-9A8F-4092B350046E", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f2f5f80af1db0234a21f89b1e410793ddc61d1bc", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1115, "id": "Q1115"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12279$7C2B1DC4-0ED5-4D8F-8611-19F0D07D98FA", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "e1689792b7d4d5d7c5e1807ce858e4cb68703f04", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 314, "id": "Q314"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12279$1B769B36-1D2E-4484-802B-F4E7CBD7F7F0", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "62e862d79dc853f73db61dacc8750af62132638d", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 314, "id": "Q314"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12279$78714BA6-92D4-49E4-BBFE-22F27F91FDA5", "rank": "normal"}]}}